<title>GREECE: SOCCER-GREECE AND PORTUGAL DRAW 0-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GREECE AND PORTUGAL DRAW 0-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece and Portugal drew 0-0 in a friendly international soccer match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
</text>
